//    Every shape is represented with its exact position/size (in inches), its
//    preset geometry, its fill, its line, and (for text frames) each paragraph
//    with every run's font size, character spacing, bold/italic, color, line
//    spacing, alignment and anchor \u2014 all taken verbatim from the source file.
// 2. At runtime we walk SLIDES_SPEC and emit the equivalent pptxgenjs calls.
//    Filled rectangles with no text become thin rules or colored bars; preset
//    ellipses become OVAL shapes; anything with text becomes a text box.
